{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requirementsAAA","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WCAG21Requirements","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/WCAG21Requirements","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/requirementsAAA"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/requirementsaaa"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WCAG 2.1 requirement for AAA level needs to have textual component matching 7:1 contrast ratio"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and non textual component matching 4.5:1 contrast ratio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is recommended for mobiles devices projects (because of screen sizes and luminosity issues)."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV15requirementsAAASb7textual_Sb10nonTextualtvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"requirementsAAA","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements"}]},"references":{"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_layers.png"}],"role":"collection","title":"Foundations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Contains a set of helpers and extensions shared for higher